From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:46:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 008/342] meson_gx_mmc: complete commands on the controller
 interrupt

Enable the controller IRQ (GIC SPI 218 for sd_emmc_c) for end-of-chain and
all error/timeout status bits; the handler collects and clears them and
wakes the issuing thread through a condition variable. Polling remains as
fallback when no interrupt is available (or MESON_GX_MMC_FORCE_POLLING).

On the ODROID-C2 eMMC (25 MHz, 4-bit) raw reads run at 11.7 MB/s either
way; the bus is the limit for large transfers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
